## Why This Is Asked

Assess practical understanding of per-tenant routing and SLA management in LLM-ops, focusing on simple guards and deterministic fallbacks rather than abstract theory.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant routing and policy application
- Latency budgeting and model selection
- Deterministic fallback behavior

## Code Example

```javascript
// Simple routing sketch
function selectModel(tenant, latencyMs) {
  const budget = tenant.budgetMs;
  if (latencyMs <= budget * 0.8) return 'small';
  if (latencyMs <= budget) return 'default';
  return 'large';
}
```

