- How would you adapt routing when a model becomes unavailable or budget changes mid-session?

## Why This Is Asked

Why: tracing + data lineage is critical for multi-tenant privacy and debugging; tests basic telemetry thinking.

## Key Concepts

- OpenTelemetry, W3C trace context
- Data lineage, tenantId propagation
- PII redaction in logs and policy checks
